## Requirements
`REQUIREMENTS.md` has the vision, design, and milestone index table. Each milestone's subtasks and resolved design questions are in `milestones/M-NAME.md`. Work on milestones in order. Each session should tackle one subtask (e.g., M-FIRST.1, M-FIRST.2).

**After completing a subtask**: mark it `[x]` in the milestone file, and if it's the last subtask, mark the milestone ✅ in the `REQUIREMENTS.md` index table.

